# Never copy host node_modules or secrets into the image. The Dockerfile runs
# `npm ci` inside the image so native modules (better-sqlite3, argon2) match its
# Node ABI. Host-built ones cause ERR_DLOPEN_FAILED at boot.
**/node_modules

# Secrets and local config, must not be baked into image layers.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Build outputs (regenerated inside the image).
**/dist
web/dist
server/dist

# Local runtime data (SQLite DB, cover cache) and logs.
**/data
*.log

# VCS / tooling / editor cruft.
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
docs
